III. E XACT SOLUTION USING LINEAR PROGRAMS
We propose an exact solution for OPT based on an MILP
program. While MILP is NP-hard in general, we show that ourinstance can be solved in PTIME in the number of input tuples.
The PTIME algorithm corresponds to a naive evaluation of the
MILP program.
A. MILP Solution for OPT
We propose an MILP program to exactly solve OPT:
